[Host] Pygmy hippos are small, rare hippos. Together with giant pandas and okapis, they are called the three rarest animals in the world.

19
00:03:00,491 --> 00:03:03,084
[Vocab] 珍しい

20
00:03:03,484 --> 00:03:06,195
[Host] It means rare, or unusual.

21
