22
00:03:20,699 --> 00:03:27,276
[Host] The baby is moving around energetically next to its mother. We don't know yet if it's a boy or a girl.

23
00:03:27,876 --> 00:03:30,108
[Vocab] 元気

24
00:03:30,508 --> 00:03:33,436
[Host] It means healthy and full of energy.

25
00:03:34,036 --> 00:03:46,228
[Slow] 赤ちゃんが元気に大きく育てば、この動物園では1994年から初めてのことになります。

26
00:03:47,027 --> 00:03:53,460
